        {
          "name": "Blend directly in ToGo bottle with leak protection: enjoy smoothies on the go easily and care-free.",
          "value": "Save time by blending smoothies directly in the ToGo bottle without re-filling or needing an adapter. Safety is guaranteed with SafeLock leak protection – a unique safety mechanism that avoids accidental opening and flooding of the drive unit. Additionally, the ToGo bottle’s lid is leak proof.",
          "source_url": "https://www.bosch-home.com/mt/en/mkt-product/MMB2111M"
        },
        {
          "name": "Easy to assemble and clean: effortless twist-in assembling mechanism, dishwasher-safe parts .",
          "value": "Comfort from beginning to end. Thanks to a twist-in ToGo bottle the assembly is as easy as possible and guided by sound effect. Cleaning is also convenient and fast thanks to dishwasher-safe parts. Removable blades ensure even more comfort.",
